ruan: NativeSandboxGrantProcess="*" grants every process (rbu64)

UniXNU's zzw-native-adreno-sandbox-grant.patch compares the property with process names only, so the "*" that sheng's board and
ruan's accelerator (package/LegacyDisplayProbe.cpp) set matched nobody: backboardd's and mediaserverd's type-0x4147 opens took the
sandbox's verdict (MACF 1, kIOReturnNotPermitted 0xe00002e2) and the Metal plugin's Turnip got VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED. An
entry "*" now matches any process. The property sits only on the native accelerator, so nothing else changes.

--- a/iokit/Kernel/IOUserClient.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/IOUserClient.cpp
@@ -4348,6 +4348,9 @@ native_sandbox_grant(IOService * service)
 		while (at[length] && at[length] != ',') {
 			++length;
 		}
+		if (length == 1 && at[0] == '*') {
+			return true;
+		}
 		/* A process name holds 16 characters, so a longer entry is compared by its first 16. */
 		if (length && 0 == strncmp(name, at, length < sizeof(name) - 1 ? length : sizeof(name) - 1)
 		    && (length >= sizeof(name) - 1 || name[length] == 0)) {
